      "blurb": "Lightning Release: Beast Lightning (B-Rank)",
      "summonRole": "Lightning Beast",
      "biography": "<p><em>Lightning Release: Beast Lightning (B-Rank) (Lightning Release Ninjutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC. You command it as a Bonus Action; it can take reactions it's able to, such as opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 14 + 4 for every rank above B-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 35 + 7 for every rank above B-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 45 ft..</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +2 (save +1), DEX +6 (save +9), CON +0 (save +1), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Acid, Lightning, Earth, Psychic. <strong>Damage Vulnerabilities</strong> Wind. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental and Sensory, Incapacitated, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
